- Story & Context: At the 'Unity Gala,' amidst the supposed grandeur of the National Brutalist Exhibition Hall, a single, taut trapeze wire, meant to symbolize the union of Elara and Kaito, snapped unexpectedly during the vows, sending a cascade of iridescent silk ribbons plummeting onto the unforgiving concrete floor, marking the first crack in the façade of forced peace; "How many threads must break to weave a single truth?" Anya "Glimmer" Hoshino's opening lyric questioned as the first harsh, metallic reverb echoed through the hall, signaling the true, fractured beginning of Gantry Anthem.
